<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenian April industrial output up 4.3 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenian April industrial output up 4.3 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following preliminary April industrial output details on Friday:</p>
<p>SLOVENIAN INDUSTRIAL OUTPUT</p>
<p>				 April    March   April 96</p>
<p> Mth/mth change (pct)    +5.6     +6.5    -0.1</p>
<p> Yr/yr change (pct)	+4.3     -1.4   +11.5</p>
<p>-- Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
